+      "solution": "Diagnosis and fix are complete and verified. The full markdown solution is at **`/workspace/solution.md`**; the referenced library is also at `/tmp/qa-fix/qa-repo-sanity.sh` and the suite at `/tmp/qa-fix/tests/run.sh`.\n\n## Summary\n\n**Root cause:** The QA launcher only classified a launch dir as \"git toplevel\" (grade it) or \"subdirectory of a repo\" (refuse). A stand-in lane is a git subdirectory of a foreign parent meta-repo, so the launcher either synced/graded the parent (wrong product) or died on `is a SUBDIRECTORY of git repo <parent>`. It never consulted the stand-in's `<dir>/.coding-hermes/board` symlink, which points into the real product repo.\n\n**Fix:** A shared `bunker_qa_resolve_repo_root()` with strict precedence:\n1. `BUNKER_QA_SUBDIR` explicit override (absolute or relative) — always wins.\n2. Stand-in board-symlink resolution: `readlink -f <dir>/.coding-hermes/board` → target dir's `git rev-parse --show-toplevel` → require `product_top != parent_top`, `product_top != launch_dir`, and exact round-trip; emit a loud `NOTE` naming launch dir, product root and symlink target.\n3. Named refusal — unchanged original guard, reached only when neither applies (same-parent, non-repo, broken/self symlinks, plain subdirs).\n\nPlus a read-only `bunker-qa resolve <repo-dir>` subcommand that prints only the decision, no agent spawn.\n\n**Verification (actually run):**\n\n```\nTOTAL: 36  PASS: 36  FAIL: 0\n```\n\nCovers positive resolution, override precedence/normalization/validation, and all negatives: same-parent symlink, non-repo target, broken symlink, self-target, plain-subdir refusal with the single FAIL evidence row, and a `$PATH` `bunker` stub proving `resolve` spawns no agent. The solution doc includes the full drop-in library, integration patch points, the complete test runner, and live read-only probe usage.\n",
+      "evidence": "# Evidence\n- Problem class: qa-harness-launch-standin-subdir-wrong-product\n- Model: openrouter/deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash\n- Solved: 2026-11-03T10:01:03.366Z\n- Verification: solution produced by pi in sandbox; see signatures.json\n",
